{"hw":"ἀποτρέπω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀποτρέπω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀποτρέπ-ω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">turn away from,</b> <span class=\"gk\">εἰ δὲ σὺ.. τιν' ἄλλον.. ἀποτρέψεις πολέμοιο</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.249</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20.256</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὅθεν.. ἀπέτραπε λαὸν Ἀθήνη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.758</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">deter</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">dissuade from,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τινός τινα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.39</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τινὰ τῆς κακουργίας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.38</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τῆς γνώμης</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.21</span> </span>, etc.: c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. προσωτέρω τὸ μὴ πορεύεσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.105</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. βοᾶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> </span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">Supp..</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">900</span> </span> (lyr.); <span class=\"gk\">δηλοῦν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">60.26</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mem.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.7.5</span> </span>,<span class=\"le