level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> c. acc. rei, <b class=\"lex-tr\">turn back again,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ποτὶ χέρσον ἔντεα ναός</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">N.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.69</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">4</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">turn aside, avert,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἀπὸ δὲ.. ἔγχεος ὁρμὴν ἔτραπε</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hes.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">455</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">pervert,</b> <span class=\"gk\">δίκας κέλευθον ὀρθᾶς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">B.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.27</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ σφάλμα ἀ.</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">prevent, avert</b> it, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.207</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ μέλλον γενέσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.65</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.29</span> </span>, al.; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. βλάβην, συμφοράν,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Grg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">509b</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phdr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">231d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. τὴν εἰρήνην</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">prevent</b> its being made, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.3.12</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">5</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">turn fr